description = "Tethers you to the target with a live current for {fx_time} sec, dealing {dot} Lightning damage {fx_every} and giving you {b:LIVE_WIRE_ENERGY} Energy each time it does. The tether breaks if you move more than {b:LIVE_WIRE_RANGE} m from the target, and you can keep only one."
